From 28d89134ef905eeebc24b68c07cff3dd32244ceb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:26:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/29] LvlLimitBoostr: '1% of all chests' and '1% of all ?
 encounters' toggles

F1 > Display > LvlLimitBoostr, both on by default (boost_chests,
boost_battles). The chest route now rolls every chest in the domains the first
time it is opened (mystery encounters or not); a chest is never rolled twice,
and one left with None keeps its LvlLimitBoostr.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
