@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ floating ? until the battle starts: 1 per floor, 30% of encounters, all except b
 (the default). It works in every view, Classic too. **A ? holds a rarer Digimon** (F1, on by
 default, `mystery_rare`) swaps each ? for one of its floor's less common enemy groups.
